    given-names: Johann
    affiliation: "MOR Research Collective"
title: "kaskaden-sandbox"
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
url: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/kaskaden-sandbox"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/kaskaden-sandbox"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Interactive evidence-graph sandbox for the published Wunderling et al.
  tipping-element network (GIS / WAIS / AMOC / Amazon). Companion UI to
  cascading-tipping-utac (GenesisAeon P87). Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET
  overlay; no Monte-Carlo engine; unclear-sign edges left unmarked as such.
keywords:
  - GenesisAeon
  - P87
  - climate
  - tipping-points
  - cascading-tipping-points
  - evidence-graph
  - open-science
